{"4488300": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cannon Clicker", "steam_appid": 4488300, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">🎖️ <strong>Build your army! Dominate the battlefield! </strong>🎖️</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow your own army from the ground up and face the enemy on the battlefields!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a <strong>World-War-inspired setting</strong>, you rise from humble beginnings to full military might – every decision brings you one step closer to victory... or defeat.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >💥 <strong>Unlock! Upgrade! Destroy!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A deep <strong>skill tree</strong> lets you unlock new unit types and boost their core stats:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Health </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Damage </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Speed</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Your base is the heart of your army – its fate decides every battle, so make sure you upgrade its <strong>defenses</strong> by providing a<strong> machinegun nest</strong> and<strong> anti-air cannons</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4488300/extras/393bf0c5f09b25e3607cc8a0cba2f56d.poster.avif?t=1787137667\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4488300/extras/393bf0c5f09b25e3607cc8a0cba2f56d.webm?t=1787137667\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4488300/extras/393bf0c5f09b25e3607cc8a0cba2f56d.mp4?t=1787137667\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >💰 <strong>Three currencies. One goal.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage three key resources:   </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ammo</strong> - earned every match, even in defeat </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Medals</strong> - rewarded for your first win on each level </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fuel</strong> - unlocks powerful, advanced units </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimize your <strong>income per second</strong> and push your army to peak efficiency!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >👀 <strong>Keep your eyes peeled</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The battlefield contains many assets for your cannony and clicky enjoyment. Take advantage of what they offer:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Landmines</strong> - Both ones planted by your allies to damage the incoming enemy forces and by your foes to hinder your efforts! Arm and disarm them respectively to maintain the advantage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resource caches</strong> - Grab 'em if you see 'em. Extra resources are nothing to sneeze at during war time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Easter eggs</strong> - The battlefield still holds even crazier mysteries! Who knows what reward you'll get if you manage to spot them?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4488300/extras/286ec64b7c79a87e850e1b3a8d402989.poster.avif?t=1787137667\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4488300/extras/286ec64b7c79a87e850e1b3a8d402989.webm?t=1787137667\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4488300/extras/286ec64b7c79a87e850e1b3a8d402989.mp4?t=1787137667\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🗺 <strong>A dynamic battle map</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Fight across a wide variety of battlefields:   </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Forests </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Farmlands </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Cities </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Mountains </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Deserts </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Swamps </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each terrain has its own difficulty and demands a different strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4488300/extras/4558db544dc37f04cc200478100a2ea7.poster.avif?t=1787137667\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4488300/extras/4558db544dc37f04cc200478100a2ea7.webm?t=1787137667\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4488300/extras/4558db544dc37f04cc200478100a2ea7.mp4?t=1787137667\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎯 <strong>Simple rules. Endless possibilities.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Destroy the enemy base → <strong>you win</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Lose your own base → <strong>you lose</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Survive to the end → <strong>tactical draw</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Replay any battle to test new builds and refine your strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4488300/extras/322ad79ce69c39a497ffdd2be0d5e894.poster.avif?t=1787137667\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4488300/extras/322ad79ce69c39a497ffdd2be0d5e894.webm?t=1787137667\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4488300/extras/322ad79ce69c39a497ffdd2be0d5e894.mp4?t=1787137667\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>   </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎺 <strong>Units on the battlefield</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command a full arsenal: <br>  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Infantry:</strong> Rifleman, SMG Soldier, MG Gunner, Anti Tank, Sniper, Mortar </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vehicles:</strong> Armored Vehicle, Tank </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Air Force:</strong> Bomber, Fighter</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every unit has its role – the key is the <strong>right combination</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cannon Clicker is a game about strategy… but also about raw, explosive fun. Watch your army grow stronger and <strong>rule the battlefield!</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">🎖️ <strong>Build your army! Dominate the battlefield! </strong>🎖️</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow your own army from the ground up and face the enemy on the battlefields!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a <strong>World-War-inspired setting</strong>, you rise from humble beginnings to full military might – every decision brings you one step closer to victory... or defeat.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >💥 <strong>Unlock! Upgrade! Destroy!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A deep <strong>skill tree</strong> lets you unlock new un